{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"rensu-e-o136","title":"仓慈到郡抑挫权右、抚恤贫羸；旧大族田地有余而小民无立锥之土，慈皆随口割赋，稍稍使毕其本直","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-cb8b7b78d603af5bf07b","label":"正文","text":"仓慈到郡抑挫权右、抚恤贫羸；旧大族田地有余而小民无立锥之土，慈皆随口割赋，稍稍使毕其本直","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1"]},{"id":"rensu-a-37d2c359aea90f9b6562","label":"正文","text":"先是属城狱讼众猥、县不能决多集治下；仓慈躬往省阅、料简轻重，自非殊死但鞭杖遣之，一岁决刑曾不满十人","evidence":["rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06"]},{"id":"rensu-a-77303edd808e17e5c121","label":"正文","text":"仓慈劳来西域诸胡：欲诣洛者为封过所，欲从郡还者官为平取、以府现物与共交市，使吏民护送道路；民夷翕然称其德惠","evidence":["rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0002","role":"抑挫权右者；省阅决狱者；抚劳诸胡者","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","source_order":[16,351,59],"order":3462}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0002","name":"仓慈","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-312dabd4207770ba85e1","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-a5527c4239142999ce0a","layer":"original","quote":"慈到，抑挫权右，抚恤贫羸，甚得其理。旧大族田地有余，而小民无立锥之土；慈皆随口割赋〖3〗，稍稍使毕其本直","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":59,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-78fc2484f1da140dbc06","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-549bbe19cab83ae4c38e","layer":"original","quote":"先是，属城狱讼众猥〖5〗，县不能决，多集治下。慈躬往省阅，料简轻重；自非殊死〖6〗，但鞭杖遣之，一岁决刑曾不满十人","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":57,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-92006e1b49a8da79668e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-549bbe19cab83ae4c38e","layer":"original","quote":"慈皆劳之，欲诣洛者，为封过所〖11〗；欲从郡还者，官为平取〖12〗，辄以府现物与共交市，使吏民护送道路。由是民夷翕然，称其德惠","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":113,"end":176,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
